%SIXMD 1
# @?MOUNTS - SHOW ROOT AND CONFIGURED MOUNT POLICY

## DESCRIPTION

MOUNTS PRINTS THE ACTIVE ROOT AND THE CURRENT FSTAB POLICY RECORDS.  THE OLD
DAIMOSV1 SYSCTL MOUNT TABLE IS NOT PART OF THE CURRENT ABI.  MOUNT AND UNMOUNT
OPERATIONS CONTINUE TO USE THE NORMAL VFS INTERFACES.

USAGE IS 'MOUNTS'.

## @?FILES

### @?/CONFIG/FSTAB
CURRENT ADDITIONAL-MOUNT POLICY.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - MOUNT POLICY WAS PRINTED
### @?1 - OUTPUT FAILED

## @?SEE ALSO

### @?MOUNT
### @?UNMOUNT
